%% Diagrama 03 - Secuencia: crear pedido sin stock
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Cliente
    participant G as API Gateway :8080
    participant O as Order Service :8081
    participant I as Inventory Service :8082
    participant DB as orders_db :5433

    C->>G: POST /api/orders (Bearer JWT)
    Note over G: Valida JWT
    G->>O: POST /api/orders (X-Trace-Id)
    O->>DB: Tx 1: INSERT order (PENDING) + items + history (null -> PENDING)
    O->>I: POST /api/inventory/reserve {orderId, items[]}
    Note over I: UPDATE condicional NO actualiza ninguna fila<br/>(available_quantity < qty)
    I-->>O: 409 STOCK_INSUFFICIENT
    Note over O: onErrorResume(...): la orden NO se revierte,<br/>se marca FAILED en su propia transacción
    O->>DB: Tx 2: UPDATE order (FAILED) + INSERT history (PENDING -> FAILED, "Insufficient stock")
    O-->>G: 409 STOCK_INSUFFICIENT
    G-->>C: 409 {timestamp, status, code: "STOCK_INSUFFICIENT", message, traceId}

    alt Inventory no responde o timeout (3 s)
        I--xO: 5xx / timeout / conexión rechazada
        O->>DB: UPDATE order (FAILED) + history (PENDING -> FAILED, "Inventory unavailable")
        O-->>G: 503 INVENTORY_UNAVAILABLE
        G-->>C: 503 {code: "INVENTORY_UNAVAILABLE"}
    end
